Submission Guidelines
You must submit a single ZIP file named with your ID number. The compressed file must contain exactly the following structure:

Main_IDNUMBER.py: The complete code file. The code should be well-documented and readable. Replace "IDNUMBER" with your actual ID number.
After running the code, the following will be generated:
lines_data.csv: A CSV file containing the DataFrame created for the input images. The columns must be: filename, x1, y1, x2, y2.
annotated_images: A folder containing the original input images, with the lines (drawn in a prominent color) that your algorithm detected using Hough Transform overlaid on them. The file names in this folder should be [Original_Name]_annotated.jpg.


